@FinancialEventCollector_HostAddress = http://localhost:5053
# API key must match ApiKey:Secret in appsettings.json (or APIKEY__SECRET env var in production)
@ApiKey = dev-key-change-in-production

### Get all event lineage views (paginated) (requires X-Api-Key)
GET {{FinancialEventCollector_HostAddress}}/events/lineage
Accept: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

###

### Get the lineage view for a single event by EventId (requires X-Api-Key)
GET {{FinancialEventCollector_HostAddress}}/events/evt-001/lineage
Accept: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

###

### Get the raw audit events and worker logs for a single event by EventId (requires X-Api-Key)
GET {{FinancialEventCollector_HostAddress}}/events/evt-001/logs
Accept: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

###

### Get the investigation prompt for event evt-001 (requires X-Api-Key)
GET {{FinancialEventCollector_HostAddress}}/events/evt-001/prompt
Accept: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

###

### Trigger an AI investigation for event evt-001 (requires X-Api-Key)
POST {{FinancialEventCollector_HostAddress}}/events/evt-001/investigations
Accept: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

###

### Get all incidents (requires X-Api-Key)
GET {{FinancialEventCollector_HostAddress}}/incidents
Accept: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

###

### Get a single incident by ScenarioId (requires X-Api-Key)
GET {{FinancialEventCollector_HostAddress}}/incidents/1
Accept: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

###

### Trigger an AI investigation for incident with ScenarioId 2 (requires X-Api-Key)
POST {{FinancialEventCollector_HostAddress}}/incidents/2/investigations
Accept: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{ApiKey}}

###
